1. Female workers/laborers under the age of 18 (eighteen) years are prohibited from being employed between 23.00 WIB and 07.00 WIB.
2. Employers are prohibited from employing pregnant female workers/laborers who according to a doctor's statement would endanger the health and safety of their pregnancy or themselves if working between 23.00 WIB and 07.00 WIB.
4. Employers are required to provide shuttle transportation for female workers/laborers who depart for and return from work between 23.00 WIB and 05.00 WIB.
